-- WoW Forever: quest and NPC changes Blizzard made on the live realm that our data did not have yet.
-- Source: quest and NPC answers from Blizzard's live servers, kept in two players' game cache folders (build 70862, 2026-11-09)
-- and in a packet log of the live realm (2026-11-07). Only quests and NPCs we already have are changed here.
-- A. Quest texts that Blizzard rewrote (only where the meaning changed; line breaks and \$N/\$n case are left alone).
-- B. Objectives: Seasoned Wolf Kabobs (90) no longer needs Stormwind Seasoning Herbs; Young Crocolisk Skins (484) needs 6 skins.
-- C. Rewards: Forever added a new item to choose from on many quests (for example The Legend of Stalvan, Colonel Kurzen,
--    Stromgarde Badges, Defeat Nek'rosh); these rows give the same reward lists as live.
-- D. NPC names Blizzard changed (Field Marshal Stonebridge, Darkspear Hunter, Defias Ambusher...).
-- Safe to run again.

-- A. texts
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Gather 10 Lean Wolf Flanks and return to Chef Grual in Darkshire.', `QuestDescription`='Seasoned Wolf Kabobs are a house favorite!  Sure, I can make you some.  But first I''ll need the supplies.  Bring me 10 Lean Wolf Flanks. Given the many wolves here in the forest, I am sure finding the Flanks will be no problem.  Fortunately for you, I just received my recent shipment of Stormwind Seasoning Herbs, so all I need are the flanks to get started.' WHERE `ID`=90; -- Seasoned Wolf Kabobs
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='I find myself in quite a pinch here, $n.  The bottles are close to running dry.  The latest booze shipment is long overdue.  The orc invasion has been hell.$b$bPerhaps you can go to work for me?$b$bI need you to pick up a cask of Merlot from Stormwind, a bottle of Moonshine from Darkshire, a skin of Sweet Rum from Goldshire, and a keg of Thunderbrew from Grimbooze. You''ll find him in the southern hills of Westfall at a camp in the Dagger Hills.  Bring those back to me and I will see to it you are rewarded.' WHERE `ID`=116; -- Dry Times
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AreaDescription`='Locate the hunters'' camp' WHERE `ID`=201; -- Investigate the Camp
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AreaDescription`='Escort Corporal Keeshan back to Redridge' WHERE `ID`=219; -- Missing In Action
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Ormer Ironbraid wants you to kill 10 Mottled Scytheclaw raptors and 10 Mottled Razormaw raptors, then return to him at the Whelgar Excavation Site.' WHERE `ID`=295; -- Ormer's Revenge
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AreaDescription`='Traverse Dun Algaz' WHERE `ID`=455; -- The Algaz Gauntlet
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Kill Chieftain Nek''rosh.$B$BBring Nek''rosh''s Head to Captain Stoutfist.' WHERE `ID`=474; -- Defeat Nek'rosh
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='I''m James Halloran, the tanner. My cured crocolisk skins are sought after all over, shipments leaving by boat to ports around the world.$b$bMet Einar? He''s one of the hunters that brings crocolisk skins in for me.$b$bI''m a bit short on the softer skins that come off crocolisk young.$b$bBeing that I''m running low, I''ll pay you top coin for a stack of the skins. You can find the young crocs in the waters right outside of town.' WHERE `ID`=484; -- Young Crocolisk Skins
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AreaDescription`='Locate the haunted island' WHERE `ID`=578; -- The Stone of the Tides
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle`='WANTED: Marez Cowl' WHERE `ID`=684; -- WANTED: Marez Cowl
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle`='WANTED: Otto and Falconcrest' WHERE `ID`=685; -- WANTED: Otto and Falconcrest
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AreaDescription`='Escort Prospector Remtravel' WHERE `ID`=731; -- The Absent Minded Prospector
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Bring 4 Minor Mana Potions and 2 Elixirs of Minor Fortitude to Lomac Gearstrip in Ironforge.' WHERE `ID`=1073; -- Ineptitude + Chemicals = Fun
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AreaDescription`='Escort Galen out of the Fallow Sanctuary.' WHERE `ID`=1393; -- Galen's Escape
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AreaDescription`='Enter the Rethban Caverns' WHERE `ID`=1699; -- The Rethban Gauntlet
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='A sayaad is a devourer of souls, dominator of wills, and tempter of hearts. It knows nothing but evil.$B$BSalacious tales refer to the demon by its common name: succubus for females, incubus for males.$B$BA stimulus is required to beckon the creature. With a symbol of love as bait, it will surely answer your call. Defeat it, and make it your tool.$B$BIt will be hard to find a thing of this nature, though. You should speak with Takar the Seer. You will find him in the Barrens of Kalimdor near Camp Taurajo.' WHERE `ID`=1716; -- Devourer of Souls
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Deliver a Jar of Snow to Norric Lochthane at his house on the northwest coast of the Loch.', `QuestDescription`='My old mentor, Norric, sent a minor elemental with an odd request. He needs a jar of snow for some of his shamanic workings! I don''t know what he''s going to do with that, but I learned a long time ago not to question his ways with respect to magic.$B$BI''m busy learning about the local elementals, so I can''t leave to help him. Go to the tunnel entrance at South Gate Pass where there''s snow year-round. Scoop some up in this ceramic jar and bring it to him before it melts. The jar should keep it cold.' WHERE `ID`=86667; -- Snowbound
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestCompletionLog`='Report to the Image of Archmage Modera near the City of Dalaran.' WHERE `ID`=92432; -- An Alarming Request
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Obtain $1oa Rough Dynamite from crafting, trading, or the auction house, then return to Sprite Jumpsprocket in the Dwarven District of Stormwind.' WHERE `ID`=92749; -- A Dynamite Plan
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='The source of the poison is likely a large metallurgical forge of some kind. Find a way into the Deadmines and locate the forge, then place the explosives.$BI will wait for you in the hills behind Moonbrook. Once you return, we can detonate the explosives. Hopefully, with the forge gone, the land can begin to heal.' WHERE `ID`=92753; -- Destruction in Deadmines
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AreaDescription`='Escort Father Tuttle to The Harborage' WHERE `ID`=93585; -- This Light of Mine
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='G''day, $Glad:lass;. Name''s Bertrand, Bertrand Ironbrow! At yer service.$B$B<Bertrand extends a filthy hand.>$B$BThese fine folk contracted me tae oversee construction of this here keep. What they lack in experience they make up for in spirit! Problem is, I misplaced me tools.$B$BHad a bit of a run in with a few Twilight in a small grove northwest o'' here. Had to choose between me life or me tools. On one hand, I''m alive. On the other... ye see where this is goin''.$B$BThink ye could help find me tools?' WHERE `ID`=95943; -- Foreman's Plight
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='Wanted! Incinerator Gar''im, Leader of an orc incursion in Render''s Valley. Purported to be working with the Blackrock of Stonewatch Keep.$B$BBeware of Incinerator Gar''im. He and his Shadowcasters are extremely dangerous. A handsome reward will be given to any brave soul that can deliver proof of Incinerator Gar''im''s demise to Magistrate Solomon.' WHERE `ID`=95999; -- WANTED: Incinerator Gar'im
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Speak with Thamner Pol in Kharanos to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.' WHERE `ID`=96047; -- Camping 101: First Aid
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Speak with Paxton Ganter near Iceflow Lake in Dun Morogh to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.' WHERE `ID`=96050; -- Camping 101: Fishing
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Defeat $1oa Splinter Fist Warriors and $2oa Splinter Fist Taskmasters then return to Sirra Von''Indi in Darkshire for more information.' WHERE `ID`=96138; -- Merrick's Bow
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='In dark times like these, it''s important we remember our heroes as much as our foes. Darkshire would not still be standing if it weren''t for the bravery of folk like the good Lady Althea or those who lost their lives at Raven Hill.$B$BHave you read much on Raven Hill? No, of course not. Its history was wiped out along with its people. My library, impressive as it is, has little on the subject.$B$BIf you happen to find anything, I''d appreciate it if you brought it here. Those folk deserve to be remembered.' WHERE `ID`=96139; -- The Valor Family
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `AreaDescription`='Take the boat to Auberdine and find Gorbold Steelhand.' WHERE `ID`=97894; -- Business in Auberdine
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='Auberdine is a humble place, $c. You won''t hear its name spoken in the boughs of Darnassus. Most reference only what the Sundering took from us--the thriving cities of Ameth''Aran, Bashal''Aran, and... Lathar''Lazal.$B$BYet Auberdine remains in their shadow.$B$BI would see our work here recognized. A new vessel connects us to the kingdom of Stormwind, bringing life and supplies to our shores. I beseech you to join its next voyage, and bring this letter to a human called Baros Alexston.$B$BMake our home known.' WHERE `ID`=97914; -- Expanding Horizons
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Speak with Betty Quin in Stormwind to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.' WHERE `ID`=97917; -- Camping 101: Enchanting
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Speak with Lee Brown near Goldshire to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.' WHERE `ID`=97920; -- Camping 101: Fishing

